Repeated division of 9 by 2:
     9 = 2 x   4 + 1
     4 = 2 x   2 + 0
     2 = 2 x   1 + 0
     1 = 2 x   0 + 1
9 in binary       : 1001
735 in binary     : 1011011111   built-in: 0b1011011111
2622 in hex       : A3E    built-in: 0xa3e
2622 in octal     : 5076   built-in: 0o5076
10110 (base 2)    = 22   built-in: 22
A3E   (base 16)   = 2622   built-in: 2622
A3C5  (base 16)   = 41925
A3C5 in binary    : 1010001111000101
0.625 in binary   : 0.101
0.1   in binary   : 0.000110011001100110011001 ... (repeats)
